			(property "Description_1" "The Raspberry Pi Compute Module 4 CM4008000 single board computer features a powerful 1.5GHz quad-core ARM Cortex-A72 processor and 8GB of RAM, making it ideal for a wide range of embedded computing applications. With 28 digital I/O lines, Gigabit Ethernet, and multiple expansion interfaces including I2C, SPI, and UART, this SBC offers multiple connectivity options. It supports video outputs such as CSI, DPI, DSI, and HDMI, providing flexibility for multimedia projects."
